<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13812" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-στᾰσίου</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκη</span> action against a freedman <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>for having forsaken his</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστάτης</span> and chosen another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὀφλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					25.65
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				35.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				58.3
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.776
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστασίου βιβλίον</span> writing or
			bill <i>of divorce,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>De.</u>
				24.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				19.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				10.4
			</span></i>: so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστάσιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					5.32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστασίου συγγραφή</span> deed <i>of
				cession, conveyance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PHib.
				1.96.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGiss.</u>
				36.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίγραφονίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					919.23
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγραφή</span> omitted, esp. in phrase 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶσις καὶ ἀποστασίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					561v
				</span></i>
			 (i A.D), etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
